For the usual dual-energy acquisition

\begin{equation*}
D_{2}\simeq2D_{1}\approx7\!-\!8\times10^{-6}\ {\rm Gy}\approx7\!-\!8\;\mu{\rm Gy}
\end{equation*}

and for a three-energy K-edge set

\begin{equation*}
D_{3}\simeq3D_{1}\approx1.1\!-\!1.2\times10^{-5}\ {\rm Gy}\approx
11\!-\!12\;\mu{\rm Gy}\approx\sim10\;\mu{\rm Gy}
\end{equation*}

per imaged surface element, i.e. $\sim4\;\mu{\rm Gy}$ per monochromatic
